--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Event_Dialogue_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 6ac2f911a5b58f6408736734707d5412, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 747245568
    m_Localized: Devorya operation confirmed. Beginning basic function test.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965824
    m_Localized: Devorya can generate four types of Fragments, each capable of performing
      a different role.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965825
    m_Localized: 'The four Fragment types are Pawn, Rook, Knight, and Bishop.

      Each
      piece moves and attacks in a different way.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965826
    m_Localized: Select the Pawn piece.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965827
    m_Localized: A Pawn can move 1 tile forward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965828
    m_Localized: Select the Rook piece.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965829
    m_Localized: A Rook can move in straight lines horizontally or vertically.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965830
    m_Localized: Select the Knight piece.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965831
    m_Localized: A Knight can jump over other pieces when moving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965832
    m_Localized: Select the Bishop piece.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965833
    m_Localized: A Bishop can move diagonally.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965834
    m_Localized: Select the Pawn piece again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965835
    m_Localized: A Pawn can attack and absorb a target located 1 tile diagonally
      forward.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965836
    m_Localized: 'An Absorption icon appears on targets that can be absorbed.

      Select
      the icon to prepare an Absorption.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965837
    m_Localized: Target data successfully absorbed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965838
    m_Localized: Devorya stores data absorbed from living beings and can use that
      data to transform its Fragments.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965840
    m_Localized: Select the Rook.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965843
    m_Localized: Select the Knight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965846
    m_Localized: Select the Bishop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965848
    m_Localized: This time, select an enemy and attack without using Absorption.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965849
    m_Localized: Without Absorption, no transformation occurs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965850
    m_Localized: 'Final test: victory condition.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965852
    m_Localized: Only a King can directly attack and absorb the enemy King.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965854
    m_Localized: Devorya restores a number of pieces equal to half the number of
      enemy lifeforms absorbed during battle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965855
    m_Localized: However, restoration cannot exceed the maximum piece capacity of
      10.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965856
    m_Localized: Basic function test complete.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965857
    m_Localized: "Beginning the next tes\u2026\u2026 t\u2026\u2026 \u2026\u2026 bzzzt\u2026\u2026
      ba\u2026\u2026sic\u2026\u2026 tes\u2026\u2026t\u2026\u2026 now\u2026\u2026
      now\u2026\u2026 n\u2026\u2026"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 784994304
    m_Localized: Beginning Devorya Fragmentation Function Test.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965853
    m_Localized: Absorb the enemy King.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965839
    m_Localized: Devorya stores data absorbed from living beings and can use that
      data to transform its Fragments.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965841
    m_Localized: A Rook can attack or absorb a target located in a straight line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965842
    m_Localized: Try absorbing the enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965844
    m_Localized: A Knight can jump over other pieces to attack or absorb a target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965845
    m_Localized: Try absorbing the enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965847
    m_Localized: A Bishop can attack or absorb a target located diagonally.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 805965851
    m_Localized: You win the battle by defeating the enemy leader, the King, or by
      eliminating all enemy pieces.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825027305472
    m_Localized: Multiple lifeform signals detected in the current area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825027305473
    m_Localized: Forced mission execution initiated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499776
    m_Localized: Generating Fragments for efficient mission execution.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499777
    m_Localized: 'All Fragments have been generated: Pawn, Bishop, Knight, and Rook.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499778
    m_Localized: Scanning basic information on nearby lifeforms...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499779
    m_Localized: Select View Info [ i ] on the interface.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499780
    m_Localized: Lifeform type confirmed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499781
    m_Localized: Repeatedly select View Info [ i ] to adjust the display of nearby
      lifeform type indicators.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499782
    m_Localized: Scanning the nearest lifeform.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499783
    m_Localized: Target scan complete.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499784
    m_Localized: The scanned target's type, Traits, Skills, and other information
      are displayed on the interface in the upper-right corner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499785
    m_Localized: Detailed information about interface icons can be viewed differently
      depending on the type of device being used.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499786
    m_Localized: '[Mobile]

      Touch and hold an icon to view its details.

      [PC]

      Hover
      the mouse cursor over an icon to view its details.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499787
    m_Localized: Absorb the scanned target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499788
    m_Localized: Stores the absorbed target's Trait, Ability, type, and form information
      in the database.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499789
    m_Localized: Reconstructs the Pawn based on the absorbed target's data.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499790
    m_Localized: Check the reconstructed Pawn's information.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499791
    m_Localized: Allied status information is displayed on the interface in the lower-left
      corner.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499792
    m_Localized: 'The target is using an Ability.

      Analyzing the opponent''s
      response.... Analysis complete.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499793
    m_Localized: 'Aggressive tendencies associated with fear, anxiety, and similar
      responses detected.

      Initiating Mental Care Protocol.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499794
    m_Localized: 'Rest assured. There will be no pain or suffering.

      At least,
      according to the data.

      Quick and easy Absorption!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499795
    m_Localized: The target's fear level has exceeded the limit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499796
    m_Localized: The opponent's Bishop-type lifeform has been confirmed to have generated
      a neutral piece with no detectable life signs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499797
    m_Localized: First, we will proceed with a rapid Absorption before the target
      escapes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499798
    m_Localized: Use the Knight to absorb the target.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499799
    m_Localized: Absorb the target and reconstruct it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499800
    m_Localized: 'Beginning strategic analysis to improve Absorption efficiency....
      Analysis complete.

      Most efficient Absorption route confirmed.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499801
    m_Localized: Use the reconstructed lifeform's Ability.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499802
    m_Localized: The generated neutral piece does not move and is an inanimate object
      that belongs to no faction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499803
    m_Localized: It can be attacked by any faction and removed through movement or
      attack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499804
    m_Localized: Attack and remove the neutral piece.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499805
    m_Localized: Use the neutral piece to move the Pawn diagonally, then threaten
      two targets at the same time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 606779965313024
    m_Localized: By absorbing various lifeforms and utilizing their Abilities, missions
      can be carried out more efficiently.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499806
    m_Localized: Select the Pawn and absorb the opponent's Knight-type lifeform.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499807
    m_Localized: Reconstructed based on the absorbed lifeform.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499808
    m_Localized: When only one enemy lifeform remains, use Devorya [King]'s 'Finishing
      Blow' to absorb it with ease.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499809
    m_Localized: No life signs detected in the surrounding area.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 23825031499810
    m_Localized: Moving to the next location.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
